"text": "A monstrous mushroom of the darkest woods, some grown as large as a cottage. The air around it is thick with spores that lay a breather down in a helpless sleep, and the threads beneath the soil then slowly eat what they have caught. Foragers who know it hold their breath and keep their distance. Careful hands can gather the spores as a poison. If the cap is burned to kill the spores, the flesh beneath is wholesome and plentiful, enough to feed a village through a lean season, though it must be eaten where it grows.",
